            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3227",
            "content": {
                "en": "As the deafening blast of rock music filled the air, the puppets charging forward suddenly faltered.",
                "zh": "伴随着摇滚曲震耳欲聋的响声，人偶原本飞速前冲的动作忽然磕绊了起来。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 15.199999809265137,
            "positionY": -3.200000762939453,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "4acaa32b-ac8a-4387-8f02-a5cbaad925f0",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3228",
            "content": {
                "en": "Page swung the fire extinguisher toward them and pressed the handle. A cloud of white mist, a mix of dry ice particles and vapor, burst forth.",
                "zh": "周书猛地将灭火器中对准前方冲来的人偶们，按下了压把。干冰微粒与水汽混合而成的白雾瞬间弥漫开来。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 428.8000183105469,
            "positionY": -3.200000762939453,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "62c2d82b-60d7-4bc6-b213-a548c568fe80",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3229",
            "content": {
                "en": "Veris saw Page dart through the fog with inhuman speed, swiftly knocking down the stiff puppets one after another.",
                "zh": "何以真看到周书以远超常人所及的速度在白雾间翻腾，几下便将僵硬地人偶们统统踹倒在地。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 831.2000122070313,
            "positionY": -3.200000762939453,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9dd600da-342f-4265-910c-3deff2a4de85",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3230",
            "content": {
                "en": "When the mist gradually cleared, only the toppled puppets lay across the cabin floor, and Page stood tall at the front, fierce and unshaken.",
                "zh": "待到白雾缓缓散去时，舱室中只剩下躺了满地的人偶，与立在最前方、英姿飒爽的周书。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1262.39990234375,
            "positionY": -3.200000762939453,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
